dit: Anna Logue Career Start The Career Network supports you in writing applications, contacting companies, and helps you to start your career. Credit: Anna Logue Mentoring Program ABSOLVENTUM, the alumni network of the University of Mannheim offers mentoring and coaching programs for the start of your career. Credit: Anna Logue Academic Career The University of Mannheim offers numerous services for early-stage reseachers. Credit: Alexander Grüber Starting Your Career International degree-seeking students can participate in workshops and information events to prepare themselves for the job market in Germany. Credit: Farina Stock Employment Agency The employment agency offers numerous services for professionals and employment advice. ENGAGE.EU Career guidance platform Discover the ENGAGE.EU Career guidance platform and take your next professional step with confidence! Whether you are crafting your elevator pitch, exploring your strength s, or preparing for an international career , ENGAGE.EU provides tailored e-learning modules , expert country insights , and a wide range of inspiring career events . From CV and LinkedIn workshops to motivation‑letter trainings and masterclasses across partner universities, you will find everything you need to shape your future. Start building your career today! Seal of the University of Mannheim: In omnibus veritas + Application Programs Online Application Choosing a Program Financing + Campus Visit Map and Directions 3D Campus Tour Eating on Campus Events + Media Relations Media Contact Finding an Expert Recording Permissions Press Releases Newsletter + Go directly to ... Portal² Mannheim University Library University IT Employment Opportunities FORUM The University of Mannheim's magazine + Getting Involved University of Mannheim Foundation Freunde Universität Mannheim Absolventum Mannheim Scholarships Contact About This Site Data Protection Declaration Barrierefreiheit Sitemap House Rules Safety and Emergencies Instagram Page of t