onal Degree-Seeking Students Prior to Your Arrival Financing your Studies Housing in Mannheim Study Peers Language Courses Tuition Fees for International Students Upon Your Arrival International Stammtisch During Your Studies Before You Leave Winners of the DAAD Prize Starting Your Career Made in Mannheim Information for Companies International Alumni Double und Joint Degree Programs ENGAGE.EU Study Offers Incoming Portraits Dates Application Deadlines Academic Calendar Examination Dates Important Dates for Prospective Students Important Dates for Freshmen Important Dates for International Students Advice and Services Advice for Students with Family Responsibilities Studying with Caregiving Responsibilities Studying while Pregnant and with Children Services for Prospective Students Advice on Choosing a Program Program Ambassadors Registration as an international Uni-Scout Admission and Enrollment Financing Services for students Changing Lanes Coaching Learning and Study Techniques Going Abroad Coming to Mannheim Social Counseling Support for the Start of your Career Services for Students in Special Circumstances Advice for Students with Disabilities or Chronic Illnesses Caregiving Resources for Teachers From High School to College Newsletter for Teachers Choosing a Major in High School Research Our Research Research Institutions ERC Grants for the University of Mannheim Good Research Practice Forschungsdaten-Policy der Universität Mannheim Research Focus Areas Markets and Businesses in Transformation Inequality, Democracy, and Public Interest Learning Individuals, Organizations, Societies, and Cultures Models, Methods, and Data Research Support Calls UMAXplore Funding Line In the Media Service for Researchers Doctorate Doctoral Studies in Mannheim Individual Doctorate Doctoral Programs Regulations and Procedures Governing the Doctoral Dissertation Admission and Enrollment Financing Insurances for Doctoral Students Internationalization Going Abroad Stays Abroad Conti