ing pages. Registration Register as a member of the Postdoc Career Academy and gain access to all funding opportunities. Register with the Postdoc Career Academy Credit: Oana Szekely Postdoctoral Research Phase – What You Need to Know What characterizes the postdoctoral research phase as the last qualification phase preceding a professorship? What career options do you have after obtaining your doctoral degree? We have compiled the most important information for you. Credit: Oana Szekely Funding Opportunities Get an overview of the most important national and EU-wide funding opportunities for postdocs and learn more about our internal funding opportunities at the University of Mannheim. Credit: Oana Szekely Further Academic Training We support your career development with a wide range of information events, workshops, and seminars. All events are free of charge and open to all postdocs and junior professors at the University of Mannheim. Credit: Oana Szekely Advice and Services We are happy to help with all questions relating to the postdoctoral research phase and your academic qualification. Find out more about our advisory and support services for doctoral candidates who are about to complete their degree and postdocs. Credit: Anna Logue Internationalization Gaining experience abroad and building international networks are fundamental prerequisites for an academic career. Learn more about the support services offered by the Postdoc Career Academy. Credit: Anna Logue Postdoc Fund As part of the Postdoc Career Academy, postdocs who are in the qualification phase can apply for a budget of up to EUR 2,000 per year, which they can use freely and independently. Contact Dr. Jayana Jain (she/her) Coordinator, Postdoc Career Academy Research Support, Academic Career Paths, Interdisciplinary Support and Counselling for Postdocs and Junior Professors University of Mannheim Divison I – Research Services and Quality Management L 1, 1 L1, 1 – Room 328 68161 Mannheim Phone: +49 