 University Vocational Training, Cooperative Study Program, Internship Internship Training Provider in Cooperative Study Programs Cooperative Study Program in Computer Science Cooperative Study Program in Business Informatics Cooperative Study Program in Digital Business Management Vocational Training Media and Information Specialist (FaMI) Library Traineeship IT Specialist for System Integration IT Specialist for Application Development Teaching Mission Statement for Teaching Course Design Qualification and Continuing Education Teaching Advice and Service Teaching Organization Lecture Recordings Course Reserves Digital teaching Transfer International Teaching Teaching Abroad Online Exchange Initiative Funds and Awards Tag der Lehre Teaching Awards Lehre@ENGAGE.EU Fund “Innovative Digital Teaching” Fund Teaching Projects Hochschulweiterbildung@BW Sustainability Program for Visiting Scholars InnoMA PePP Data Literacy Information for Teachers The MaDaLi² Project E-learning course Mannheim Data Literacy (MaDaLi²) Service Learning Lehre @ ENGAGE.EU Getting Involved University of Mannheim Foundation Freunde der Universität Mannheim Other Foundations and Funding Honors Counseling and Services Schools Department of Law Department of Economics Business School School of Social Sciences School of Humanities School of Business Informatics and Mathematics Intranet + Skip to main navigation Skip to page content Skip to footer Schools Department of Law Department of Economics Business School School of Social Sciences School of Humanities School of Business Informatics and Mathematics Search Barrierefreiheit EN DE EN Menu Credit: Staatliche Schlösser und Gärten Baden-Württemberg University Research Postdoctoral Research Phase Postdoc Career Academy Advice and Services Advice and Services Find out more about our advisory and support services on the following pages. We will assist you in all areas of both university life and career development – feel free to contact us! Credit: Anna Logue Career Planning Are you aiming for a career in academia? Do not hesitate to contact us. We are happy to advise you! We will provide you with comprehensive information and help you plan the next steps on the way to a professorship. Credit: Anna Logue Research Funding and External Funding Learn more about our services supporting you in acquiring external funding. We provide you with support and advice from the initial idea to the submission of your research proposal. Credit: Anna Logue Teaching and Didactics Anyone looking for inspiration for teaching and supervising students or who is interested in continuing education in didactics will find comprehensive advice and support at the Teaching and Learning Center. Credit: Anna Logue Research Data Management The Research Data Center (FDZ) of the University Library will assist you in planning the handling of research data and results in a forward-looking and sustainable manner. More services for researchers and teachers University Library Open Science Office Research communication Data protection team Ethics Committee Are you interested in something else? No problem! The Postdoc Career Academy is the first point of contact for all questions and concerns you may have during the postdoctoral research phase. Dr. Jayana Jain will be happy to assist you. Dr. Jayana Jain (she/her) Coordinator, Postdoc Career Academy Research Support, Academic Career Paths, Interdisciplinary Support and Counselling for Postdocs and Junior Professors University of Mannheim Divison I – Research Services and Quality Management L 1, 1 L1, 1 – Room 328 68161 Mannheim Phone: +49 621 181-1018 E-mail: jayana.jain @ uni-mannheim.de Web: Postdoc Career Academy Seal of the University of Mannheim: In omnibus veritas + Application Programs Online Application Choosing a Program Financing + Campus Visit Map and Directions 3D Campus Tour Eating on Campus Events + Media Relations Media Contact Finding an Expert Recording Permissions Press Releases Newsletter + Go directly to ... Portal² Mannheim University Library University IT Employment Opportunities FORUM The University of Mannheim's magazine + Getting Involved University of Mannheim Foundation Freunde Universität Mannheim Absolventum Mannheim Scholarships Contact About This Site Data Protection Declaration Barrierefreiheit Sitemap House Rules Safety and Emergencies Instagram Page of the University of Mannheim Facebook Page of the University of Mannheim LinkedIn Page of the University of Mannheim Tiktok Page of the University of Mannheim YouTube Page of the University of Mannheim Mastodon Page of the University of Mannheim In order to improve performance and enhance the user experience for the visitors to our website, we use cookies and store anonymous usage data. For more information please read our privacy policy . Allow Reject Tracking cookies are currently allowed. Do not allow tracking cookies Tracking cookies are currently not allowed. Allow tracking cookies × How would you like to open the file? Remember for next time View PDF document Download PDF document"
